  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.35 Materially or significantly affect project cost or estimated revenues",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.35 “Materially or significantly affect project cost or estimated revenues” means a change in estimated costs or revenues of more than 10%.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
